        "id": 361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-07-08T09:31:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As discussed offline, the contract is that the backend returns an error if any operation in the batch fails. Successfully processed flows must still update `driver_data`: set `hw_if_index` on enable and clear it on disable. Since a batch may be partially completed, callers requiring per-flow results must iterate over the requested flows and inspect their state. Therefore, no additional core postcondition loop is needed here.",
      "parentUuid": "241a87a7_2cdf64a6",
      "revId": "2c91346ff0a0dc73258ffe29c5fda2cac0a486d6",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
    },
